      "label": "",
      "text": "The DMS catalog archive shall provide catalog data and associated metadata on request in community standard formats:\n• Comma-separated ASCII text • eXtensible Markup Language (XML) format, including VOTable (http://www.ivoa.net/twiki/bin/view/IVOA/IvoaVOTable), and • FITS tables.",
